# Files a fresh worktree needs that git doesn't carry, copied into every worktree Claude Code makes —
# including the throwaway one a subagent gets, so what's named here should be small.
# Same syntax as .gitignore, and only files that match here *and* are ignored are copied, so nothing
# tracked is ever duplicated. See https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees
#
# Deliberately not here: supporter-key.pem and supporter-codes*.txt. A signing key belongs in one place
# outside the repository (docs/releases/kofi.md), not copied into every checkout on the disk.

# Where the SDK is, so :app builds without being set up again.
local.properties

# The Mockup Lab's own code, which every UI change goes through. About 360 KB.
docs/mockups/*.html
docs/mockups/*.js
docs/mockups/lab/*.html
docs/mockups/lab/*.css
docs/mockups/lab/*.js
docs/mockups/lab/*.py
docs/mockups/lab/*.md
docs/mockups/lab/*.svg
docs/mockups/lab/scenes/**
docs/mockups/lab/data/**

# The feature walls' structure, but not their captures: 4.2 MB of screenshots stays in the checkout that
# took them, and a wall opened in a worktree names the files it's missing rather than failing to load.
docs/mockups/lab/walls/index.json
docs/mockups/lab/walls/README.md
docs/mockups/lab/walls/*/wall.json

# The preview servers, so `preview_start` knows the same names in a new worktree.
.claude/launch.json
